Ben: But you got to! You got to! You got to!

289
00:19:34,300 --> 00:19:37,000
出租车司机:不,我不去,我不去,我不去.
Skipper: No, I don't! I don't! I don't!

290
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:40,700
本:你听我说,我要把我的生活找回来.
Ben: But you don't understand. I gotta get my life back.

291
00:19:43,100 --> 00:19:44,820
出租车司机:我要是让你找回生活,
Skipper: Well, if I let you get your life back,

292
00:19:44,820 --> 00:19:45,100
那就会让别人失去好生活的.
then I gotta let everybody get their lives back.

293
00:19:45,100 --> 00:19:46,000
本:可是我……
Ben: But I wanna…

294
00:19:48,560 --> 00:19:51,480
出租车司机:不过你要是想到别的地方去,那我倒是可以的,
Skipper: If you can figure out a new place to go, then I'm your man.

295
00:19:51,640 --> 00:19:59,400
短程的或者远程的,三个小时的也可以.你小子干什么?
Short trip, long trip. Heck, three hour tour! What are you doing?

296
00:19:59,400 --> 00:20:34,400
本:不知道.太好了我能开车了.
Ben: I don't know! Holy Cow! I can drive!

297
00:20:36,740 --> 00:20:49,180
本:嘿,这有人吗?我不喜欢这个地方.
Ben: Hey! Is anybody here? I don't like the looks of this. Neither do I.

298
00:20:55,180 --> 00:20:55,200
我也不喜欢.玛奎兹医生,我回来了.
Dr. Marquez! I'm back.

299
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:57,400
玛奎兹医生:护士,今天到此为止.
Dr. Marquez: Nurse. Let's call it a day.

300
00:20:57,400 --> 00:21:00,300
本:我改变主意了,我愿意把扁桃体割掉.
Ben: I've changed my mind. I'm happy to have my tonsils out.

301
00:21:00,300 --> 00:21:03,300
护士:好了医生,那明天早上再见.
Nurse: Alright, Doctor. See you in the morning.

302
00:21:03,300 --> 00:21:07,400
本:你们割我的什么都可以,割我的阑尾,我求你了.
Ben: Or anything else you want to take out. Take my appendix, please!

303
00:21:07,400 --> 00:21:11,600
玛奎兹医生:明天早点,做手术的人很多.
Dr. Marquez: Get here early, we got a lot of people to cut up!

304
00:21:11,600 --> 00:21:14,100
护士:不能等!
Nurse: Can't wait!

305
00:21:14,100 --> 00:21:22,800
本:不能等!!
Ben: No!

306
00:21:22,800 --> 00:21:25,300
本:妈妈,爸爸,迈克,开萝尔.
Ben: Mom! Dad! Mike! Carol!

307
00:21:25,300 --> 00:21:27,900
杰森:你别讲话.
Jason: Save your voice. Don't try to talk.

308
00:21:27,900 --> 00:21:29,800
本:你们听得见我吗?
Ben: You guys can hear me?

309
00:21:29,800 --> 00:21:32,200
迈克:当然能听见.
Mike: Always.

310
00:21:32,200 --> 00:21:35,300
本:我改变主意,我决定把我的扁桃体割掉.
Ben: I changed my mind. I'm happy to have my tonsils out.

311
00:21:35,300 --> 00:21:37,800
杰森:抱歉,太晚了.
Jason: Uh, sorry. You're too late.

312
00:21:37,800 --> 00:21:39,700
本:哦,不,不,不.
Ben: Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no.

313
00:21:39,700 --> 00:21:43,600
麦琪:你爸爸的意思是,你不能再割第二次了本.
Maggie: No, honey. What your father means is that you can't take them out again, Ben.

314
00:21:43,600 --> 00:21:44,900
本:你喊我本.
Ben: You called me Ben.

315
00:21:44,900 --> 00:21:46,300
麦琪:是啊.
Maggie: Yea.

316
00:21:46,300 --> 00:21:49,500
杰森:你一生下来就是这样喊你的.
Jason: Well, we've been doing that since you were a kid.

317
00:21:50,760 --> 00:21:55,860
本:今天不是,因为我逃回家,
Ben: Not today, cause see I went home cause I didn't want my tonsils out

318
00:21:56,280 --> 00:21:57,680
因为我害怕把扁桃割掉,
and you guys were there,

319
00:21:57,860 --> 00:22:00,800
你们都在那可看不见我,那有个小混蛋你们都喊他Ben.
but you didn't see me and there was this weeny guy and you called him Ben.

320
00:22:00,800 --> 00:22:04,200
迈克:那小混蛋是你.
Mike: Ben, you're the weeny.

321
00:22:04,200 --> 00:22:07,200
麦琪:你说的准是梦里的事,小南瓜.
Maggie: That must've been some dream, pumpkin.

322
00:22:07,200 --> 00:22:08,500
本:喊我声本.
Ben: Call me Ben.

323
00:22:08,500 --> 00:22:09,700
麦琪:本.
Maggie: Ben.

324
00:22:09,700 --> 00:22:11,100
本:谢谢.
Ben: Thank you.

325
00:22:11,100 --> 00:22:16,900
杰森:你看这都是因为你害怕看刀,所以才会做出这种怪梦,问题出在这儿.
Jason: So your fears about this operations and all those wild dreams you had, well, that's all up here.

326
00:22:16,900 --> 00:22:19,800
开萝尔:他脑子里也就这么点玩意儿.
Carol: That's about the only thing up there.

327
00:22:22,860 --> 00:22:23,580
本:爸爸,妈妈,
Ben: Mom, Dad, Everybody.

328
00:22:23,940 --> 00:22:27,600
哥哥,姐姐我想对你们说,我能够姓西维尔真使我激动.
I just want to say being a Seaver makes me feel really swell!

329
00:22:27,600 --> 00:22:29,700
家人:激动?
Everybody: Swell?

330
00:22:32,040 --> 00:22:34,460
本:这是真的,现在开始我要做一个最最好的孩子,
Ben: I'm serious. From now on,

331
00:22:34,460 --> 00:22:36,580
我要干干净净的,
I'm gonna try to be the best Ben I can be.

332
00:22:36,780 --> 00:22:38,000
不再乱喊乱叫,不再做怪事.
No more pigging out, no more screaming, no more weird stuff.

333
00:22:38,000 --> 00:22:41,300
杰森:不知道他们给他用的哪种麻药.
本:妈妈爸爸我想告诉你们,我为姓西维尔而自豪.你,你,你!
00:22:41,300
Jason: What kind of anesthesia did they give him? Ben: Mom, Dad. I just want to say, I'll be proud to be a Seaver. You! You! You!
